  {
   "claim": "Across studies, average heart rate in padel match play is about 70-80% of maximum.",
   "source": "Physiological demands of padel: mini review 2023, Frontiers in Sports and Active Living",
   "url": "https://frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fspor.2023.1284063/full"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Padel injury surveys most often report the elbow, lower back, shoulder, knee, calf and ankle, and most injuries are overuse.",
   "source": "Performance requirements and injury incidence of padel: a narrative review",
